OL,3,GNEWSATraders sympathise as lights
OL,4,Aswitch-on axed again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stand alone Christmas lights
OL,7,Fswitch-on show will not be brought
OL,8,Fback, despite concerns the move could
OL,9,Faffect businesses.
OL,11,FWorcester City Council said the cost of
OL,12,Fstaging a separate event rose from
OL,13,F#5,389 in 2023 to #15,058 in 2024.
OL,14,FInstead, the city's Christmas lights
OL,15,Fswitch-on will again form part of the
OL,16,Fopening of the city's Victorian
OL,17,FChristmas Fayre.
OL,19,FIt is the second year a separate event
OL,20,Fwill not be held because of costs. In
OL,21,F2024, the event was cancelled due to
OL,22,Fbad weather.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
